<p>Hey! Appreciate the DM reminder. Apologies for making you wait. I get wrapped up in other things and forget to check back in ‘round here.</p>
<p>Okay, so, you have a decent set-up here. It’s a little 2011 but there’s nothing wrong with that. But I do think what you have is only a basic starter for a robust SCP article and it’s pretty close to SCP-610.</p>
<p>I want to know more about these characters. I need you to bring them to life for me because what you have here are cardboard cut-outs. You have a decent creepy idea but you need to a) flesh it out into a full-fledged story, and b) differentiate it from SCP-610 a little more. And I think the characters are where you can accomplish that.</p>
<p>I can’t give you a greenlight but I want you to marinate on the world you’re creating until someone else else does. Your big hurdle here is figuring out the story you want to tell with the framework you’ve created. Don’t be afraid to reach out to an experienced author if your idea goes another few days without further comment.</p>
<p>Godspeed, homie. ✌️</p>

